With \code{transitions = "occasion"}, \code{transition_covariates},
\code{initial_covariates}, \code{measurement = "occasion"}, \code{order = 2},
\code{mover_stayer = TRUE}, \code{weights}, \code{ordinal} or \code{count}, the result is a
